01A8   21A1           00036 loopX   CALL    onems           ; Delay 1ms
Message[305]: Using default destination of 1 (file).
01A9   0BF1           00037                 DECFSZ  TimerX          ; Repeat X times 
01AA   29A8           00038                 GOTO    loopX           ; until Z
01AB   0008           00039                 RETURN                  ; and finish
                      00040 
                      00041 ;--------------------------------------------------------------
